 <description>Diodes BAS70DW-04-7-F: 4 x 70 V Schottky diodes in SOT-363 (SC-70-6), wired as two series pairs with all six nodes available (A1/AC1/C1 and A2/AC2/C2). Pin order differs from BAS70BRW; usable as a 4-diode bridge.</description>
